  "description": "Filled contour map of a smoothed field: for each place, its share of all winter (June–August) records divided by its share of all summer (December–February) records, 2024. Contours fall on a constant interval of one doubling. Toggle between all bird records and rainbow bee-eater records. Grey land has too few records to estimate.",
